                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "     The graphics are are a bit jarring at first, but I like the characters and it has some good tunes, especially the rockin' tunes you'll hear later in the game. The writing is fun and humorous, and the battle system uses a three color element system that has you making the enemy vulnerable to a type of \"verbal argument\" before taking them out. The haunted mansion's a cool part of the game, and the few puzzles you'll run into are a challenge of their own. \n     I finished it in around 25 hours after doing most of everything and spending time on the puzzles, so there's a good amount to do, along with the few ending you can get depending on what you've completed at the time. HATCHET THE EQUINOX!",
